			description: ["The &6Antimatter Trap&r, &6Positron Accumulator&r, &6SRF Cavity Works&r, &6Nuclear Clock Lab&r, &6X-Ray Pulse Profiler&r, &6PBO Plant&r and &6Warp Gate&r each take a row: antiproton stacking, seed plasma, RRR niobium, a thorium lock, an XNAV calibration, chain braid and the three OpV gates. The controllers you already own, and the cold antiprotons from Cygnus. Stacks, the pathfinder, the chain cable and the gates to the places and to MAX. Stacks and cells ride the relay between sites."]
