		{
			dependencies: ["7F4169BDA6339C6F"]
			description: ["The &6Pasta Extractor&r, &6Pasta Phase Sorter&r, &6Draw Bench&r and &6Laminator&r, built for the pulsar, take a magnetar site and rows for chain crust, caged phases, chain strand and lamina. The &6MTJ Sputter Cluster&r takes eight films. The UXV controllers you already own, and a platform at the magnetar. Chain strand, the hull plates and every sputtered film of the circuit lines. Cages return from the sorter. Targets arrive by bus."]
